DTSTAMP:20260707T233104Z
DTSTART:20260611T163000Z
DTEND:20260718T210000Z
SUMMARY:Coca-Cola Fan Zone at JAX District
DESCRIPTION:JAX District in Diriyah will host the Coca-Cola Fan Zone from June 11 to July 19. The fan zone is a dedicated destination for football fans\, bringing together live match screenings\, entertainment activities\, and interactive experiences in an atmosphere suitable for all ages. The venue gives visitors the opportunity to enjoy the excitement of the tournament beyond the stadiums\, with spaces designed to make every match a shared experience filled with energy and support.
LOCATION:Diriyah
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-coca-cola-fan-zone-at-jax-district.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:event-ruh-space@eventme.live
DTSTAMP:20260707T233104Z
DTSTART:20260613T160000Z
DTEND:20260718T230000Z
SUMMARY:Ruh Space
DESCRIPTION:Experience the FIFA World Cup 2026 at Ruh Space\, a premium fan destination located in VIA Riyadh. Designed for football enthusiasts\, the venue offers live match screenings in an upscale setting that combines the excitement of the tournament with exceptional hospitality. Guests can enjoy curated dining experiences from renowned restaurants\, including Madeo and Ferdi\, alongside a range of tailored experiences that create a memorable World Cup atmosphere in the heart of Riyadh. Book Now
LOCATION:VIA Riyadh
URL:https://eventme.live/events/event-ruh-space.html
END:VEVENT
